{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/readiumshared\/contentsearchservice"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"ReadiumShared"}],"fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ContentSearchService","kind":"identifier"}],"symbolKind":"class","roleHeading":"Class","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"ContentSearchService","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"ContentSearchService","externalID":"s:13ReadiumShared20ContentSearchServiceC","role":"symbol"},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ContentSearchService"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"text":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"It supports cross-element matching within the same resource via a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"sliding window","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" over the resource’s concatenated element texts. The window"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"maintains a "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"danger zone","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" (last "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"T","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" characters) where matches are deferred"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to the next iteration, enabling queries that span element boundaries (e.g.,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"<p>The quick<\/p><p>brown fox.<\/p>","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" matches “quick brown”)."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Cross-resource matching is intentionally not supported (the window is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"flushed at every resource boundary).","type":"tex